    "changes_to_existing": [
      "U_GETKEY must return physical modifier qualifiers: X bit 7 Control, bit 6 Shift, bit 4 Help, with SDX A/N/Z behavior. Current MD5/ARC service returns X=0 and cannot drive EDX control commands.",
      "INPUT already captures Shift/Control qualifiers, but the ordinary console byte stream discards them. Extend reusable per-instance key delivery through the console owner; do not acquire a competing global keyboard lease from the editor.",
      "Retain BREAK cancellation outside ordinary key FIFO semantics. EDX uses negative input results for exit paths; native cancellation must remain authoritative through cleanup.",
      "FOPEN/FREAD/FWRITE/FCLOSE need an EDX file profile with ordinary bounded document and save paths. Existing ARC mutation ownership and MD5 read-only policy do not admit arbitrary EDX writes.",
      "FOPEN read uses mode 4/scan $80. Save uses mode 8/scan $58/attr 0, one near contiguous document buffer and one open file at a time.",
      "Both load/save install U_SFAIL to the continuation +$063E. The error handler closes the selected file, calls U_PERROR into the line buffer, draws the message and waits for a key. Native error and cancellation cleanup precedence needs dedicated checks."
    ]
  },
